{"id":"552e996c15863488","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-monadic-adjunction.md","title":"Definition — 伴随比较函子及指定伴随的单子性","display":"Definition — 伴随比较函子及指定伴随的单子性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-monadic-adjunction","aliases":["14-df-monadic-adjunction"],"display":"Definition — 伴随比较函子及指定伴随的单子性","source_ref":"IV.4 equations (4)–(5), printed 178; DjVu 95","source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。","verification_status":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked","depends_on":["[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","[[14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad]]","[[14-df-monad-algebras]]","[[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]","[[14-df-functor]]","[[14-df-category-equivalence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-monadic-adjunction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-monadic-adjunction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — 伴随比较函子及指定伴随的单子性"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"IV.4 equations (4)–(5), printed 178; DjVu 95"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"assistant-semantic-review; not-proof-assistant-checked"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9c709097572b96e4\" href=\"?note=9c709097572b96e4\" title=\"14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad\">14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e28e85ec3a8dde78\" href=\"?note=e28e85ec3a8dde78\" title=\"14-df-monad-algebras\">14-df-monad-algebras</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"733785fa2bb6eb61\" href=\"?note=733785fa2bb6eb61\" title=\"14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction\">14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1f1269584b34ad4b\" href=\"?note=1f1269584b34ad4b\" title=\"14-df-functor\">14-df-functor</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c502117a84587a7c\" href=\"?note=c502117a84587a7c\" title=\"14-df-category-equivalence\">14-df-category-equivalence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\">\\(F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是指定单位 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta\">\\(\\eta\\)</span>、余单位 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 的伴随数据，满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d2b4e5cf16585f95\" href=\"?note=d2b4e5cf16585f95\" title=\"14-df-adjoint-functors\">14-df-adjoint-functors</a> 的两条三角式。取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9c709097572b96e4\" href=\"?note=9c709097572b96e4\" title=\"14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad\">14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=GF\">\\(T=GF\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu_A=G(\\varepsilon_{F(A)})\">\\(\\mu_A=G(\\varepsilon_{F(A)})\\)</span>。代数范畴及自由/遗忘函子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e28e85ec3a8dde78\" href=\"?note=e28e85ec3a8dde78\" title=\"14-df-monad-algebras\">14-df-monad-algebras</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,D&#39;\">\\(D,D&#39;\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> 对象；比较函子记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf K\">\\(\\mathsf K\\)</span>，避免与代数对象的通用字母混同。单子性谓词保留所指定伴随的全部参数；范畴等价采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c502117a84587a7c\" href=\"?note=c502117a84587a7c\" title=\"14-df-category-equivalence\">14-df-category-equivalence</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf K_0(D)\\coloneqq(G(D),G(\\varepsilon_D)),\\qquad\n\\mathsf K_1(u)\\coloneqq(\\mathsf K_0(D),\\mathsf K_0(D&#39;),G(u))\n\\quad(u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(D,D&#39;)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf K_0(D)\\coloneqq(G(D),G(\\varepsilon_D)),\\qquad\n\\mathsf K_1(u)\\coloneqq(\\mathsf K_0(D),\\mathsf K_0(D&#39;),G(u))\n\\quad(u\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal D}(D,D&#39;)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf K\\coloneqq(\\mathsf K_0,\\mathsf K_1),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(\\mathsf K,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C^T),\\qquad\nU_T\\circ\\mathsf K=G,\\qquad \\mathsf K\\circ F=F_T.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf K\\coloneqq(\\mathsf K_0,\\mathsf K_1),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{IsFunctor}(\\mathsf K,\\mathcal D,\\mathcal C^T),\\qquad\nU_T\\circ\\mathsf K=G,\\qquad \\mathsf K\\circ F=F_T.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{IsMonadicAdjunction}(F,G,\\eta,\\varepsilon)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsEquivalence}(\\mathsf K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{IsMonadicAdjunction}(F,G,\\eta,\\varepsilon)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{IsEquivalence}(\\mathsf K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书印刷178（DjVu95）公式(4)–(5)给出比较函子。其底层作用不是另选一个函子，而是指定伴随强制产生的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>。这里的单子性相对于已声明伴随数据；原书称右伴随 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 单子，意为它有一个左伴随且该比较函子为等价，不要求严格范畴同构。</p>\n<p>对对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span>，三角式给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\varepsilon_D\\eta_{GD}=1\">\\(G\\varepsilon_D\\eta_{GD}=1\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\">\\(\\varepsilon\\)</span> 在箭头 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_D:FGD\\to D\">\\(\\varepsilon_D:FGD\\to D\\)</span> 处的自然性给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon_DFG\\varepsilon_D=\\varepsilon_D\\varepsilon_{FGD}\">\\(\\varepsilon_DFG\\varepsilon_D=\\varepsilon_D\\varepsilon_{FGD}\\)</span>；施以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 得代数结合律。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u:D\\to D&#39;\">\\(u:D\\to D&#39;\\)</span>，余单位自然性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\varepsilon_D=\\varepsilon_{D&#39;}FG(u)\">\\(u\\varepsilon_D=\\varepsilon_{D&#39;}FG(u)\\)</span> 施以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>，恰是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G(u)\">\\(G(u)\\)</span> 的代数态射关系。保持恒等和复合由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 的函子律及代数箭头标签直接得到。</p>\n<p>遗忘后两分量均与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 相同。对自由对象 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(A)\">\\(F(A)\\)</span>，比较代数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(GFA,G\\varepsilon_{FA})=(TA,\\mu_A)\">\\((GFA,G\\varepsilon_{FA})=(TA,\\mu_A)\\)</span>，箭头作用为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"GF(f)=T(f)\">\\(GF(f)=T(f)\\)</span>，所以与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_T\">\\(F_T\\)</span> 严格相等。定义没有隐去单子的来源或比较函子的选择。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-adjoint-functors]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad","status":"resolved","id":"9c709097572b96e4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-monad-algebras","status":"resolved","id":"e28e85ec3a8dde78","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-monad-algebras]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction","status":"resolved","id":"733785fa2bb6eb61","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-free-algebra-adjunction]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-functor","status":"resolved","id":"1f1269584b34ad4b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-functor]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"c502117a84587a7c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-adjoint-functors","status":"resolved","id":"d2b4e5cf16585f95","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$、$G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C$ 是指定单位 $\\eta$、余单位 $\\varepsilon$ 的伴随数据，满足 [[14-df-adjoint-functors]] 的两条三角式。取 [[14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad]] 的 $T=GF$、$\\mu_A=G(\\varepsilon_{F(A)})$。代数范畴及自由/遗忘函子见 [[14-df-monad-algebras]]。$D,D'$ 是 $\\mathcal D$ 对象；比较函子记 $\\mathsf K$，避免与代数对象的通用字母混同。单子性谓词保留所指定伴随的全部参数；范畴等价采用 [[14-df-category-equivalence]]。","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-adjunction-induced-monad","status":"resolved","id":"9c709097572b96e4","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$、$G:\\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C$ 是指定单位 $\\eta$、余单位 $\\varepsilon$ 的伴随数据，满足 [[14-df-adjoint-functors]] 的两条三角式。取 [[14-thm-adjunction-induce